  "plain": "The Apollo astronauts who went to the Moon were all given some kind of pill that would kill them if anything went wrong. The documentary filmmaker James Fox repeats this from a woman named Fay Ann Potter, who said NASA officials had told her so. If true, it would mean NASA planned for its astronauts to die rather than be stranded or caught in some disaster."
